ass=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/blog/mythological-animal-names/\">Mythological Names</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/blog/norse-viking-animal-names/\">Norse Viking Names</a></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 pt-6 border-t border-gray-800 text-center text-xs text-gray-500\"><p>© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Animal Name Generator. All rights reserved.</p></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0wa60lc2wlwoc.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[54576,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3i2zmhpv5m7u2.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"GoogleAnalytics\\\"]\\n3:I[22016,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3i2zmhpv5m7u2.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\n4:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3i2zmhpv5m7u2.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n5:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3i2zmhpv5m7u2.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n10:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3i2zmhpv5m7u2.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0_novvjei_gxi.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"editorial-policy\\\",\\\"\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"editorial-policy\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{}]}]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",16],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0_novvjei_gxi.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"script-0\\\",{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chun