rences, and real-world naming trends reported by animal shelters and breeders.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Human Review\"}],\" — Every candidate name is evaluated by our editorial team against clear quality criteria: ease of pronunciation, positive associations, distinctiveness, and suitability for the specific animal species.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Category Assignment\"}],\" — Names are sorted into categories based on their tone and typical usage context. A name like “Thor” belongs in Cool or Fantasy categories, while “Marshmallow” fits Cute or Funny.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Species Relevance\"}],\" — We never copy-paste the same list across different animals. Names for a horse should reflect equine characteristics, while names for a hamster should suit a small, gentle companion.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Regular Refreshing\"}],\" — Collections are updated regularly as new naming trends emerge, pop culture introduces new references, and readers submit suggestions.\"]}]]}]]}],\"$L12\",\"$L13\",\"$L14\",\"$L15\",\"$L16\"]}]],null,\"$L17\"]}]\n18:[]\ne:\"$W18\"\nf:[\"$\",\"$1\",\"h\",{\"children\":[null,[\"$\",\"$L19\",null,{\"children\":\"$L1a\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"hidden\":true,\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L1b\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$1c\",null,{\"name\":\"Next.Metadata\",\"children\":\"$L1d\"}]}]}],null]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/chunks/0_novvjei_gxi.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]\n1e:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3i2zmhpv5m7u2.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/14mrh2-p_w84d.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n12:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\",\"children\":\"How We Write Blog Articles\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Our blog covers animal naming guides, pet care naming tips, breed-specific advice, cultural naming traditions, and creative naming inspiration. Every article follows this process:\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-disc pl-6 mt-3 space-y-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Topic Selection\"}],\" — We choose topics that real pet owners and animal lovers are actually searching for, based on keyword research, reader requests, and gaps in existing online resources.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Research & Fact-Checking\"}],\" — Writers consult veterinary publications, ethology research, breed standards from kennel clubs, zoological references, and cultural naming guides. Every factual claim is verified before publication.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Drafting\"}],\" — Articles are written by experienced writers with genuine knowledge of the subject. We do not publish AI-only content without human review.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Editorial Review\"}],\" — Each draft goes through an editorial check for accuracy, readability, completeness, and adherence to our quality standards.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Publishing & Updates\"}],\" — Once published, articles are periodically reviewed and updated to reflect new research, naming trends, and reader feedback.\"]}]]}]]}]\n13:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\",\"children\":\"Quality Standards\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Every piece of content on BestAnimalNames.com must meet these baseline requirements:\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-disc pl-6 mt-3 space-y-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Accuracy\"}],\" — Animal facts and naming information must be verifiable from reputable sources.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Completeness\"}],\" — Each animal page must include all eight name categories with at least 20 suggestions per category.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Originality\"}],\" — We do not scrape or duplicate content from other websites. Every page is original.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Accessibility\"}],\" — Content is organized with clear headings, readable fonts, high-contrast design, and proper ARIA labels for screen readers.\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Transparency\"}],\" — We clearly distinguish editorial content from advertisements. No sponsored content is published without disclosure.\"]}]]}]]}]\n14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4\",\"children\":\"Corrections & Feedback\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"We are committed to accuracy and continuous improvement. If you find an error, outdated information, or a name suggestion you believe is inappropriate, please let us know immediately:\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3\",\"children\":[\"📧 \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Email:\"}],\" \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"mailto:support@bestanimalnames.com\",\"className\":\"text-primary hover:underline\",\"children\":\"support@bestanimalnames.com\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-1\",\"children\":[\"📝 \",[\"$\",\"strong\",null,{\"children\":\"Contact Form:\"}],\" \",[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/contact/\",\"className\":\"text-primary hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Contact Us page\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-3\",\"children\":\"We review all reports within 48 hours on weekdays and correct verified error